      },
      {
        "heading": "Which agencies, vendors, and industries account for most FY2027 spending?",
        "body": "The Department of Veterans Affairs led buying with $40.9M, followed by the General Services Administration with $29.4M and the Department of the Treasury with $21.4M. GENERAL DYNAMICS INFORMATION TECHNOLOGY, INC. was the top vendor with $19.3M, followed by ERNST & YOUNG LLP with $8.8M and CENSEO CONSULTING GROUP, INC. with $8.1M. Other Computer Related Services was the largest industry with $43.4M, followed by Computer Systems Design Services with $20.3M and Software Publishers with $9.8M."
